# Implementation Plan - Mock College Database Design & Functionalities

This document outlines the implementation plan for expanding the database schema and adding functionality for the Campus Service Copilot as described in `Mock_College_Database_Design.md`.

## Goal Description
Extend `prisma/schema.prisma` and `prisma/seed.js` with complete, realistic college database models and relationships (Departments, Sections, Students, Faculty, Subjects, Seminar Halls, Fee Payments, Exam Records, Hostel Allocations, Library Records), sync the database schema, update seeding scripts, and enhance agent tools/services to query and operate against this real data.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Database schema will be updated with new models and updated relations (`prisma db push`).
> - The seed script will ingest realistic mock data for 8 departments, sections, students, faculty, subjects, fee records, exam marks, hostel allocations, library records, lab resources, and seminar halls.
> - Tools and service layers will be extended to support student profile resolution, fee status/receipt queries, exam record lookups, section-aware lab bookings, and seminar hall bookings.

## Open Questions
None. The design document `Mock_College_Database_Design.md` provides explicit schemas, field types, default values, query patterns, and sample seed records.

